@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Pre-exam readiness check (Module 2):
' ViewModels/DashboardViewModel.InitializeAsync (GET /api/exams/student/current gives the requirements) / RunReadinessAsync /
' RetryReadinessItemAsync / ReportReadinessAsync (status "Could not reach server" when the POST fails), UpdateStartEligibility
' (CanStartExam = CanResumeExam || (gateOpen && AttendanceConfirmed && (!RequireReadiness || ReadinessPassed))),
' Services/Readiness/ReadinessCheckService.RunAsync, Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy (EvaluateNetwork, EvaluateCamera,
' EvaluateSecureMode), Services/ApiClient.SubmitReadinessAsync,
' Controllers/ExamsController.SubmitReadiness (POST /api/exams/{id}/readiness: 404 when not assigned; READINESS_PASSED /
' READINESS_FAILED audit row; SaveChangesAsync seals it via AuditChain; hub "ReadinessUpdated" to group exam:{id}).
' Open arrowhead (->>) = asynchronous message with no reply (SignalR push).
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

actor Student
participant "Dashboard\nViewModel" as VM
participant "Readiness\nCheckService" as RCS
participant "ApiClient" as API
participant "Exams\nController" as EC
database "AppDbContext" as DB
participant "Monitoring\nHub" as HUB

Student -> VM : Run check
activate VM
loop for each of the 7 checks
  VM -> RCS : RunAsync(check,\nrequirements)
  activate RCS
  RCS --> VM : ReadinessItemResult
  deactivate RCS
end
note over RCS, DB
requirements (RequireWebcam, RequireMic, BlockMultiMonitor, LockdownMode)
come from GET /api/exams/student/current, loaded with the dashboard
Network: GET /api/health, best try <= 2 s;  ClockSkew <= 60 s;  ScreenCapture works
Camera*: picture not dark, exactly one face (YuNet);  Microphone*: device found
SecureMode (unless Off): 1 monitor if multi-monitor blocked; no RDP; no VM;
keyboard hook installs;  Disk >= 200 MB free   (*) only if the exam requires it
end note
VM -> API : SubmitReadinessAsync(examId,\n{passedAll, machineName, results})
activate API
API -> EC : POST /api/exams/\n{id}/readiness
activate EC
EC -> EC : assigned (else 404)?\npassedAll = all passed\n+ required Camera/Mic
EC -> DB : SaveChangesAsync\n(+ReadinessCheck,\n+AuditLog READINESS_\nPASSED or _FAILED)
activate DB
DB --> EC : saved; AuditChain\nsealed the AuditLog\nrow (Sequence,\nPrevHash, Hash)
deactivate DB
@enduml
